  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bcr 216.02 Action on Petitions for Declaratory Rulings.\n\n(a) The petitioner shall provide such further information as the board shall direct after reviewing the petition.\n\n(b) Petitions shall be dismissed when the board lacks subject matter or personal jurisdiction.\n\nSource. #8044, eff 2-17-04; renumbered by #8323 (from Bcr 215.02); ss by #10073, INTERIM, eff 1-17-12, EXPIRES: 7-16-12; ss by #10161, eff 7-13-12",
